From 0d9c1b1cf3daac10bdd029d35d48a7b7ce0a149a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang YiHe <108562510+nmhjklnm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 05:07:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gugu: forward native blocking Stop hook notices

Why: decision/reason-only Stop command hooks resume the model without an informational frame. Enable native lifecycle events and forward successful blocking responses through ACP notices, including autonomous cycles without a prompted Turn. Keep native systemMessage output on its existing lane, ignore terminal continue:false, and never infer hooks from assistant prose.

Upstream: none yet.

Drop when: upstream enables and forwards blocking Stop responses through ACP notices.
